	(text "NUCLEO-F446ZE via jumper wires - pin map in docs/driver-pinout.md\nJ7 -> Nucleo: SCK D13/PA5, MISO D12/PA6, MOSI D11/PA7, CSN D10/PD14,\nDRV_ENN D9/PD15, BRAKE_CTRL D8/PF12, DIAG0 D2/PF15, DIAG1 D5/PE11,\nFLT# D6/PE9, VBUS_ADC A0/PA3, GND CN7-8 + CN8\nOnly GND is common - Nucleo 3V3 is NOT connected to the board 3V3.\nMCU->board lines: 1k series (R15, R16, R56, R57) limits back-feed into an\nunpowered board and damps ringing on the wires. Keep SPI <= 2 MHz.\nFail-safe: jumper off / MCU in reset -> DRV_ENN and CSN pulled high\n(driver off); BRAKE_CTRL gate pull-down is in the brake stage (#74)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 90.17 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e51ec65c-2c90-4b88-9dd3-2b879b90792f")
	)
